# Karn, Argent Defender: "Artifacts and creatures entering the battlefield don't cause abilities to trigger" (CR 603.2, 603.6a). Bot1's Tezzeret, Cruel Captain gets a
# loyalty counter whenever an artifact enters under its controller's control: Mox Sapphire, cast before Karn, puts one on it (4 -> 5, the control). Then Karn
# himself, an artifact creature entering, causes nothing (his own entering is stopped too), nor does Ornithopter, nor does the Clue. A Forest is neither an artifact
# nor a creature, so Tireless Tracker's landfall still triggers and makes the Clue (the rulings: "If a nonartifact, noncreature land enters ... the ability will
# trigger"); Tezzeret stays at 5 although the Clue is an artifact entering.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Tezzeret, Cruel Captain
Mox Sapphire
Karn, Argent Defender
Ornithopter
Tireless Tracker
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x14

